{
  "era": "wotlk",
  "format": "living-azeroth-npc-summaries",
  "map": 668,
  "npcs": [
    {
      "entry": 36723,
      "name": "Frostsworn General",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:36723:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:b911bb7373d88801c99e576c",
            "source:b94ca491763db7e06c980681",
            "source:783d745aaa478ff7b5a2d64d",
            "source:b832eb42d95ca647a5e1236c"
          ],
          "text": "The Frostsworn General is a powerful commander who bars the heroes from reaching the Lich King, declaring them unworthy. In defeat, he calls the Lich King “Master” and says he has failed, marking him as a devoted subordinate.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 36723
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 36954,
      "name": "The Lich King",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:36954:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:b93f8611890099e0c9c19f65",
            "source:3bd8d1017e029f259a91bf22",
            "source:5d985f43713831a252d65fef",
            "source:4be1a6dc001a9fb97ad51d92",
            "source:c0047ff648a7eb3ed2d6d052",
            "source:f5f5b1af53e2a147140c35ea",
            "source:11a584d97597cb96da188ff8"
          ],
          "text": "In the Halls of Reflection encounter, the Lich King pursues Jaina and her allies, threatening to make them agents of the Scourge. He vows revenge on Sylvanas, saying he will not repeat an earlier mistake, and taunts the trapped heroes as he closes off their escape with ice walls. His words convey possessive menace and confidence in their eventual capture.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 36954
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 36955,
      "name": "Lady Jaina Proudmoore",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:36955:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:35fa0d464f3adc3b1adb5350",
            "source:169b8202a00ff11c0a0d558a",
            "source:48df6d73c98d0535a710a671",
            "source:faedae770e6a0032180361ec",
            "source:8571e7229708c40e06c9900f",
            "source:697ad9f80b69879daf311dfa",
            "source:7c1ca937bf5bc48f44e2fcb0"
          ],
          "text": "Lady Jaina Proudmoore leads the heroes' desperate retreat from the Lich King. She uses her magic to hold him briefly and break ice barriers while the group keeps undead attackers at bay. When the route ends, she calls for a last stand; she then says she will deliver what they have learned to King Varian and Highlord Fordring. Her urgent commands show resolve under pressure.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 36955
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 37014,
      "name": "Ice Wall Target",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:37014:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:0cdacd3d961a8c9a7870cacf",
            "source:0fb1430d51cc31755978cf68"
          ],
          "text": "Ice Wall Target is a mechanical target entity in the Halls of Reflection area.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 37014
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 37068,
      "name": "Spiritual Reflection",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:37068:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:96aaef843fb61ac6b291bb38",
            "source:37a5e4d1711763598dd0e98b"
          ],
          "text": "Spiritual Reflection is a humanoid in the Halls of Reflection.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 37068
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 37221,
      "name": "Lady Jaina Proudmoore",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:37221:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:f1ce13bfd9521696a8c57561",
            "source:b0ad4d6ff755d991422a0531",
            "source:37c57e2002aaeb429798881f",
            "source:3734e6b15b4a6850f15ef492"
          ],
          "text": "In the Halls of Reflection, Jaina confronts Frostmourne, the blade that destroyed her kingdom, and longs to learn what became of her prince, Arthas. Uther's counsel steadies her when grief overwhelms her; she intends to take what she learns to the King and the knights fighting the Scourge in Icecrown Citadel.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 37221
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 37223,
      "name": "Lady Sylvanas Windrunner",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:37223:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:1ddedadd86bc308cbd00e28d",
            "source:4979a6f1cd41df8805912974",
            "source:e459119e3577e0df3b5fb637",
            "source:cc63ca8a3ecbdf8a91d32085",
            "source:0643c5be9c4f92beed527255"
          ],
          "text": "Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, the Banshee Queen, faces Frostmourne as the blade that ended her life; its presence renews her pain. She dares not touch it and attempts to commune with it, hoping salvation lies within. When the Lich King appears, she sees her destiny at hand and vows vengeance on Arthas.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 37223
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Banshee Queen"
    },
    {
      "entry": 37225,
      "name": "Uther the Lightbringer",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:37225:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:8054952f20f311ce3a262b32",
            "source:bc6007773e2aa7fcfd89f482",
            "source:da9a27c52dee42a1b0d5ea83",
            "source:a5374444601d8e4780e49892",
            "source:8e7dae599ff7b6e4f0579bf9"
          ],
          "text": "Uther the Lightbringer appears in the Halls of Reflection as a voice Jaina recognizes. He warns that the Lich King can see through Frostmourne and that the Scourge would devastate the world without a master to control it. Uther suspects that whatever remains of Arthas may be holding the Scourge back, though he admits he does not know for certain.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 37225
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Knight of the Silver Hand"
    },
    {
      "entry": 37226,
      "name": "The Lich King",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:37226:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:cf606d51b11b3f3681c9065c",
            "source:aad35094f23aa09f626d90f5",
            "source:a8dd6efc284757eb98768605"
          ],
          "text": "The Lich King commands Falric and Marwyn to bring him their opponents' corpses, silences a paladin, and promises to grant the wish to commune with the dead. His speech presents him as a forceful commander who treats the living as subjects of his will.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 37226
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 37554,
      "name": "Lady Sylvanas Windrunner",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:37554:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:6d2e9e5f7d101a6e912226ac",
            "source:c2e6ae3409c0150be7b43831",
            "source:214e8881b00415116a4b2433",
            "source:bc284639e0ac3546177fc212",
            "source:af7fd38f788301b9cd185b40",
            "source:b35c54ce61121489deeccad7",
            "source:b22fbde674fbe2312748d7b4"
          ],
          "text": "Lady Sylvanas Windrunner leads the Horde's escape from the Halls of Reflection while confronting the Lich King. Driven by vengeance, she works to break barriers and hold him back, but judges his growing strength beyond what even the Horde can overcome. She values capable Horde champions and believes Uther's information may help bring Arthas down.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 37554
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 37582,
      "name": "Archmage Koreln",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:37582:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:8ccc0ddff2eabff1f6e7e72c",
            "source:12ba6220a4a05021485e98ab",
            "source:c04e82139fa0d598aa3674b8"
          ],
          "text": "Archmage Koreln is identified as a Kirin Tor archmage associated with a quest in the Halls of Reflection.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 37582
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Kirin Tor"
    },
    {
      "entry": 37704,
      "name": "Frostmourne Altar Bunny (Quel'Delar)",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:37704:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:22eaa21116efab418fa3279d",
            "source:588e9496b846742b26cd5e31"
          ],
          "text": "At the Frostmourne altar, this helper is associated with the moment Quel'Delar leaps to life in Frostmourne's presence.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 37704
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 38112,
      "name": "Falric",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:38112:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:79374c896634b0693fbbea85",
            "source:20194204b13189792b31bb3a",
            "source:870a8191dc30dd0a3defe0e1",
            "source:f2ad1fba1d26bd421e2fcd82",
            "source:13f98f17fe15dbe76cc3f2d3",
            "source:b2699169ef49b6c71c2453bd"
          ],
          "text": "Falric serves a master he addresses as “my lord” and orders Marwyn to finish their foes. He invokes the slaughter at Stratholme to threaten opponents and taunts them in battle.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 38112
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 38113,
      "name": "Marwyn",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:38113:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:ce37c003c8b9bcfd9278b677",
            "source:35ef86a1fcb590fedc19f156",
            "source:3707c047cce7876c5625cc47",
            "source:2b685c945f65e62ef1f3b8ff",
            "source:b018782a1666b99b31143d1b",
            "source:7123c8d5f0c48cbd93637297",
            "source:6958775f86e70d77e21ae98c"
          ],
          "text": "Marwyn serves the master and answers his command. He recalls seeing the same look in a man's eyes when he died, then mentions Terenas's disbelief; he threatens foes with death and suffering.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 38113
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 38172,
      "name": "Phantom Mage",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:38172:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:2cff0e53902e853ce6773543",
            "source:71dea9c8aa8b0c3da813884b",
            "source:ad64456ca8ac4bcf1eac58af",
            "source:c16b8579cefbe8f870d17053"
          ],
          "text": "A Phantom Mage serves the master in death and speaks of souls that will never be freed and torment that will never end.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 38172
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
